# See https://help.github.com/articles/ignoring-files/ for more about ignoring files.

# dependencies
/node_modules
/infra/node_modules
/.pnp
.pnp.*
.yarn/*
!.yarn/patches
!.yarn/plugins
!.yarn/releases
!.yarn/versions

# testing
/coverage
/test-results/
/playwright-report/

# next.js
/.next/
/out/

# production
/build

# infrastructure build artifacts
/infra/cdk.out/
/infra/dist/
/infra/outputs.json

# misc
.DS_Store
*.pem
AWSCLIV2.pkg

# debug
npm-debug.log*
yarn-debug.log*
yarn-error.log*
.pnpm-debug.log*

# env files (can opt-in for committing if needed)
.env*

# vercel
.vercel

# typescript
*.tsbuildinfo
next-env.d.ts

# 内部戦略ノート(コミット禁止)
docs-private/

# blog drafts kept private (see veai-jp-web/docs-private/drafts)
drafts/

# --- 非公開の作業ドキュメント（公開フォルダに置いても追跡しない安全策）---
docs-private/
.private/
private/
*-private.md
**/WORKLOG*.md
**/*_HANDOFF.md
**/PROJECT_HANDOFF*.md
**/*-todo.md
**/human-todo.md
**/active-todo.md

# Python のバイトコード（scripts/ のガードとそのテストを走らせると出る）
__pycache__/
